## 3. Responsive, Overlap-Free, Speed & Optimization
- **Zero Layout Overlaps**: Strict container boundary control, flex/grid wrapping, and overflow prevention on all screen sizes.
- **Full Responsiveness**: 100% adaptive across Mobile, Tablet, Laptop, and Desktop.
- **Performance**: High frame rate, minimal re-renders, fast asset loading, optimized CSS.

## 4. Dark & Light Mode + Arabic (RTL) & English (LTR)
- **High Contrast Dark & Light Themes**: Ensure full readability in both themes without washed-out text or background bleed.
- **Bilingual RTL/LTR**: Proper bidirectional flow for Arabic (`rtl`) and English (`ltr`), keeping spacing and icons properly oriented.

## 5. Database & Backend Integrity Protection
- Existing database tables, foreign keys, migrations (`apps/api/database/migrations/`), and SQL scripts (`database/hostinger/`) are **strictly protected**.
- Never alter API response structures or database columns without explicit architectural requirement.
- Multi-tenant tenant boundary (`store_id`) must remain untouched and strictly enforced across all queries and payload requests.

## 6. Mandatory Module Testing & Production Build Validation
- Every module must pass comprehensive testing and `npm run build` with zero TypeScript or bundling errors before proceeding.
